Principles, my ass.

00:55:03.864 --> 00:55:06.075
Are you rich enough
that you don't need a job?

00:55:06.158 --> 00:55:09.203
You said you have no parents,
that it's just you and your brother.

00:55:09.286 --> 00:55:10.454
I get that.

00:55:11.247 --> 00:55:12.498
I get it all too well.

00:55:12.581 --> 00:55:14.250
I was in the same boat.

00:55:14.959 --> 00:55:16.710
Pride doesn't put food on the table.

00:55:25.761 --> 00:55:28.889
This is unexpected.
I thought you were determined to resign.

00:55:28.973 --> 00:55:29.974
I know.

00:55:31.142 --> 00:55:32.518
I'm surprised at myself too.

00:55:32.601 --> 00:55:33.936
You made a good decision.

00:55:34.854 --> 00:55:36.897
Quitting in anger
only ends up hurting you.

00:55:38.107 --> 00:55:40.359
Yoon Jung-ho dropped the lawsuit.

00:55:40.860 --> 00:55:43.154
How did you do it?
Did you get on your knees and beg?

00:55:43.237 --> 00:55:45.114
He dropped the lawsuit? When?

00:55:46.198 --> 00:55:47.074
An article just came out.

00:55:48.325 --> 00:55:49.160
You've got some skill.

00:55:54.623 --> 00:55:56.250
TOP ACTOR YOON JUNG-HO
JOINS KANG PIL-GU'S AGENCY

00:55:57.668 --> 00:55:58.919
Is he insane?

00:55:59.003 --> 00:56:01.297
Wow, Kang Pil-gu really is amazing.

00:56:01.881 --> 00:56:04.508
How'd he manage to join
Lim Hyeon-jun's agency and have it sorted?

00:56:09.388 --> 00:56:10.347
What…

00:56:10.431 --> 00:56:11.932
TOP ACTOR YOON JUNG-HO
JOINS KANG PIL-GU'S AGENCY

00:56:23.819 --> 00:56:26.906
What kind of rich people
have hobbies like this?

00:56:27.740 --> 00:56:30.409
I guess life is pretty much
the same for everyone.

00:56:31.076 --> 00:56:31.952
By the way, bro.

00:56:32.036 --> 00:56:35.247
Seriously, why did you suggest
that we recruit Mr. Yoon Jung-ho?

00:56:35.831 --> 00:56:38.125
-You didn't even know him well.
-Right.

00:56:38.209 --> 00:56:39.793
And he gets 90%?

00:56:39.877 --> 00:56:42.338
Man, you were so stubborn about it
that I just gave in,

00:56:42.421 --> 00:56:43.839
but we're not some charity!

00:56:43.923 --> 00:56:45.424
Ninety to ten?

00:56:45.507 --> 00:56:47.384
Hold on, bro. Tell me the truth.

00:56:47.468 --> 00:56:48.677
Does he have something on you?

00:56:49.178 --> 00:56:50.387
No.

00:56:50.471 --> 00:56:51.722
Then why do I only get 10%?

00:56:53.265 --> 00:56:55.142
I wonder if he gets any script offers.

00:56:55.226 --> 00:56:56.769
Yes, of course.

00:56:56.852 --> 00:56:59.271
His fees are pretty high
for someone his age.

00:56:59.355 --> 00:57:00.940
He gets a lot of calls.

00:57:01.815 --> 00:57:03.400
How long is his contract with us?

00:57:05.319 --> 00:57:09.073
You insisted that we make it
an exclusive five-year contract.

00:57:10.407 --> 00:57:11.325
Good job.

00:57:12.326 --> 00:57:14.745
If any offers come in for Yoon Jung-ho,

00:57:14.828 --> 00:57:15.663
turn them down.

00:57:16.830 --> 00:57:18.374
Movies, dramas, commercials, events…

00:57:18.457 --> 00:57:19.875
Don't take any offers at all.

00:57:20.626 --> 00:57:23.462
Make sure he can't do a thing.

00:57:24.129 --> 00:57:25.673
No managers, transportation, or stylists.

00:57:25.756 --> 00:57:27.299
Don't provide any support.

00:57:28.300 --> 00:57:30.344
Cut him off from everyone

00:57:31.470 --> 00:57:33.430
-until he's forgotten.
-But why?

00:57:34.014 --> 00:57:35.516
Have you heard of "private revenge"?

00:57:36.183 --> 00:57:37.476
No. Why do you ask?

00:57:38.769 --> 00:57:39.728
I can't apologize.

00:57:40.312 --> 00:57:41.230
Not to that piece of trash.

00:57:41.313 --> 00:57:42.147
That piece of trash…

00:57:43.732 --> 00:57:45.484
He's sexually harassed women for years!

00:57:45.567 --> 00:57:47.361
I'll hand in my resignation
before I apologize!

00:57:47.945 --> 00:57:48.946
I'd gladly take that loss

00:57:50.364 --> 00:57:51.949
on my own.

00:57:53.075 --> 00:57:54.285
I want to try getting

00:57:55.202 --> 00:57:56.287
some private revenge.

00:57:57.037 --> 00:57:57.913
Why?

00:58:02.960 --> 00:58:04.670
Hello, Chairman Lee!

00:58:05.254 --> 00:58:07.339
President Lee, you're here too?

00:58:07.840 --> 00:58:08.924
Goodness.

00:58:09.675 --> 00:58:11.260
-It's been a while.
-Yes, sir.

00:58:12.344 --> 00:58:14.263
-Nice to meet you.
-Hello, sir.

00:58:16.223 --> 00:58:17.099
Nice to meet you.

00:58:18.309 --> 00:58:19.518
Hello, sir.

00:58:19.601 --> 00:58:20.519
I'm Lee Dae-ho.

00:58:20.602 --> 00:58:22.104
Pleased to meet you, sir.

00:58:22.896 --> 00:58:24.231
I'm Lim Hyeon-jun.

00:58:24.315 --> 00:58:26.817
Mr. Lim, put that down.
Why are you carrying it?

00:58:26.900 --> 00:58:28.944
-You left it behind…
-Put it down.

00:58:29.028 --> 00:58:30.904
This is my younger brother.

00:58:30.988 --> 00:58:32.531
You know Lee Jae-hyeong,
the baseball player?

00:58:32.614 --> 00:58:33.991
-Of course, sir.
-Oh, yes.

00:58:34.908 --> 00:58:35.909
We've met before, right?

00:58:35.993 --> 00:58:37.202
Yes.

00:58:38.412 --> 00:58:39.580
Nice to see you.

00:58:40.080 --> 00:58:41.665
Nice to see you too.

00:59:20.162 --> 00:59:21.747
SIMPLE AND EASY, TAILORED FIT!

01:00:10.546 --> 01:00:12.756
SPECIAL THANKS TO OH YEON-SEO
FOR HER APPEARANCE

01:00:12.840 --> 01:00:15.843
Why is my fan page
so active all of a sudden?

01:00:15.926 --> 01:00:16.760
"Soulishere"?

01:00:16.844 --> 01:00:19.012
Thank you, Soulishere.

01:00:19.555 --> 01:00:20.389
No way!

01:00:20.472 --> 01:00:22.224
Melomaster, you should post something too.

01:00:22.307 --> 01:00:23.267
Are you dating someone?

01:00:23.350 --> 01:00:25.227
-I'm not dating anyone.
-You're so dating!

01:00:25.811 --> 01:00:27.146
Something's different this time.

01:00:27.229 --> 01:00:28.605
You like that guy, don't you?

01:00:29.523 --> 01:00:31.150
I want to get to know you better.

01:00:32.651 --> 01:00:34.445
I'll be waiting by the love locks
at the N Seoul Tower.

01:00:36.321 --> 01:00:37.990
Do you believe in the Way?

01:00:38.073 --> 01:00:39.783
Are you making fun of me?

01:00:43.328 --> 01:00:45.330
Subtitle: Jenny Kim